    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "About Contact Setup",
      "id": "about",
      "intro": "Contact Setup adalah modul dalam ShiFor yang digunakan untuk mendaftarkan dan mengelola informasi kontak penerima (recipients) notifikasi. Kontak ini menghubungkan nama individu (Firstname, Lastname) dengan saluran platform komunikasi (Email, Telegram, WhatsApp) dan nilai alamat kontak spesifik (alamat email, Telegram chat ID, atau nomor WhatsApp).",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Fungsi Contact Setup",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Notification Destination:** Menentukan ke mana notifikasi dari alert keamanan akan dikirimkan secara langsung.\n• **Supported Platforms:** Mendukung pendaftaran platform utama seperti Email, Telegram, dan WhatsApp dengan ikon identifikasi dinamis.\n• **Contact Type Association:** Setiap entitas kontak yang dibuat dapat diasosiasikan sebagai individu penerima tunggal maupun dikelompokkan ke dalam satu grup penerima (Contact Group).\n• **Audit Trail Logging:** Mencatat setiap siklus hidup pembuatan, perubahan alamat kontak, dan penghapusan data penerima.",
          "color": "#2563eb",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(37,99,235,.08);border:1px solid #dbeafe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1c65fe 0%,#0055ff 60%,#0039b5 100%);padding:20px 22px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.1) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:16px 16px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;\"><div style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.3px;\">Contact Setup</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);margin-top:3px;\">Recipient Management Engine</div></div><div style=\"margin-left:auto;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">Contacts</span></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:16px 18px;\"><div style=\"border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;padding-top:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-bottom:6px;\">Saluran Platform</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(234,179,8,0.1);border:1px solid #eab308;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#ca8a04;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"/></svg>Email</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);border:1px solid #6366f1;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#4f46e5;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z\"/><path d=\"M22 2 11 13\"/></svg>Telegram</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.1);border:1px solid #22c55e;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"/></svg>WhatsApp</span></div></div></div></div>"
